      "width": 460,
      "height": 360,
      "text": "ADMISSIONS PAGE — DESKTOP\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ PROCESS STEPPER (Horizontal)               │\n│ ① Enquire → ② Apply → ③ Assess →          │\n│ ④ Interview → ⑤ Admit                      │\n│ (Current step highlighted, lines connect)  │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ REQUIREMENTS (2-column grid, 8 items)      │\n│ ┌─────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐    │\n│ │ 📄 Birth Cert   │ │ 📄 Transfer     │    │\n│ │    Certificate  │ │    Certificate  │    │\n│ └─────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘    │\n│ ┌─────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐    │\n│ │ 📄 Medical      │ │ 📄 2 Passport   │    │\n│ │    Report       │ │    Photos       │    │\n│ └─────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘    │\n│ ┌─────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐    │\n│ │ 📄 Parent ID    │ │ 📄 Proof of     │    │\n│ │    Copies       │ │    Residence    │    │\n│ └─────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘    │\n│ ┌─────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐    │\n│ │ 📄 Academic     │ │ 📄 Immunization │    │\n│ │    Records      │ │    Records      │    │\n│ └─────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘    │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ FAQ ACCORDION (8 items)                    │\n│ ▼ What is the admission age?              │\n│ ▼ Is there an entrance assessment?        │\n│ ▼ What are the fees?                      │\n│ ▼ Do you offer scholarships?              │\n│ ▼ What curriculum do you follow?          │\n│ ▼ Is transport available?                 │\n│ ▼ How do I apply?                         │\n│ ▼ When does the academic year start?      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ CTA: [Start Application →] (Full width)    │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
